# An action rather than `kind: packages`, because deno installs a *binary*
# whose name it derives from the package's own metadata: there is no mapping
# from `@openai/codex` back to the command it produced, so the engine has
# nothing to diff against. The script installs unconditionally, which deno
# treats as an overwrite.
kind: action
capabilities: develop
requires: node-toolchain
optional: deno
